# Next.js App Router

- `apps/web/app/` — **routing only**; business logic in `features/`, cross-feature in `shared/`, infra in `core/`
- Private colocation: `_folder` prefix inside `app/` (not routes)
- Route boundaries: `loading.tsx`, `error.tsx`, `not-found.tsx`
- Default **Server Components**; `'use client'` only when needed
- No secrets/env in client modules
- Mutations: **Server Actions** (`'use server'`) + `revalidatePath`; handle errors gracefully

Coding principles: KISS, YAGNI, DRY; SOLID (S & O) for components.
